      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1235035" metaid="metaid_70" name="Expression of Carbonic Anhydrase IX (CA9)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The gene encoding carbonic anhydrase IX (CA9) is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. Hypoxia-inducible factor binds the promoter of CA9 and enhances expression of CA9.</p>
        </notes>
