      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_1234173" metaid="metaid_73" name="Cytosolic PHD2,3 hydroxylates proline residues on HIF3A" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Proline hydroxylases PHD2 (EGLN1) and PHD3 (EGLN3) located in the cytosol (Metzen et al. 2003) hydroxylate HIF3A at proline-492 (Hirsila et al. 2003, Maynard et al. 2003). A portion of PHD3 (EGLN3) is also located in the nucleus (Rantanen et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
