      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_1234179" metaid="metaid_74" name="Cytosolic PHD2,3 hydroxylates proline residues on EPAS1 (HIF2A)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Proline hydroxylases PHD2 (EGLN1) and PHD3 (EGLN3) located in the cytosol (Metzen et al. 2003) hydroxylate EPAS1 (HIF2A) at proline-405 and proline-531 (Hirsila et al. 2003, Percy et al. 2008, Furlow et al. 2009). A portion of PHD3 (EGLN3) is also located in the nucleus (Rantanen et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
