      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1235070" metaid="metaid_83" name="Expression of Erythropoietin (EPO)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The EPO gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. Transcription of EPO is enhanced by Hypoxia-inducible factor, which binds to the EPO promoter. The HIF heterodimer binds the promoter of the EPO gene and recruits p300 and CBP to enhance transcription of EPO.</p>
        </notes>
